y twice the numbers of the Red Talons, things would be looking up for the Garou Nation. ^(VVVVVVV)^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T19:35:56-07:00","id":936857,"title":"","content":"Wish I could remember. Might be its in one of the books of the wyrm. Knowing my luck probably the minds eye one, which I don't think is canon for classic world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T09:24:11-07:00","id":937132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/886461-werewolfs-in-germany-where-are-they?p=936754#post936754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thought they equaled out to something like 2 combined tribes (clearly not gnawers).</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC, The BSDs are the largest Tribe and are twice as large as the next largest. But that still doesn't mean they outnumber Gaian Garou. It just means they're somewhere between 12% and 66% of the Garou population.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T18:53:36-07:00","id":939264,"title":"","content":"Oh i think you misunderstand me. I didn't mean the spirals outnumbered the gaians, just that they made up a bulk of the werewolf population, but on the whole the werewolves are massively outnumbered by their enemy forces. As in, in total, not by spirals alone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T11:21:10-07:00","id":939662,"title":"","content":"Yes, but that includes mortals, fomori, vampires, etc. Vampires alone outnumber Garou by 5:1 globally, though any combat oriented Garou would not even consider five average vampires to be a decent challenge (five combat oriented vampires may cause them concern though). Garou have one advantage though, they probably have one hundred Kinfolk for every Garou, a number that I found was necessary to mathematically sustain Garou populations, if you assumed an average Pure Breed of 0 (quite sensible as the Kinfolk of Bone Gnawers and Glass Walkers, two of the most common tribes, cannot possess Pure Breed), and if you assume that fifty percent of the Kinfolk will likely breed with mortals rather than Garou or Kinfolk (which would reflect modern social norms). <br /> <br /> The number of Kinfolk are probably 1:5,000 of the mortal population (in Germany, they will likely human, since there are only around 100 wolves in Germany, divided into 14 packs, all of whom are probably wolf Kinfolk). That would suggest that there would be around 16,000 Kinfolk in Germany, 15,900 Human and 100 Wolf, who would probably be primarily rural in population (though Bone Gnawers and Glass Walker Kinfolk will favor urban areas). I would put the local Kinfolk population at 40% Get of Fenris, 20% Black Spiral Dancer, 10% Bone Gnawer, 10% Glass Walker, 10% Silent Strider (primarily Middle Eastern and North African immigrants), and 10% Other (Children of Gaia, Silver Fangs, etc).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}